        ],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "Built to your choice",
          "title": "Why you will not find a price list here",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Each self-playing instrument is built around the instrument you choose, so the price follows your choices. Automating a Chinese accordion costs far less than an Italian one. For a pipe instrument you can have us make the pipes, or deliver your own. The same goes for drums, bars and cases.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Tell us what you have in mind and we send you a quote for exactly that instrument.",
              "spans": []
            }
          ],
