      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [
          {
            "point": "Use one instrument alone or several together"
          },
          {
            "point": "Standard MIDI: General MIDI drum notes on the percussion"
          },
          {
            "point": "Play live from a keyboard, sequencer or DAW"
          }
        ],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "One ensemble",
          "title": "Every self-playing instrument speaks MIDI",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Each instrument works on its own. Connect them and they play as one band: an accordion, a percussion unit and a xylophone can follow the same arrangement, each taking its own part.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The Accordion Pedestal and Cube have MIDI in, out and thru. The Bellow Organ can lead the others as MIDI master or follow them as slave. The same instruments can be built into the façade of a new organ.",
              "spans": []
            }
          ],
          "image": {
            "dimensions": {
              "width": 1536,
              "height": 1024
            },
            "alt": "A pianist and a self-playing accordion performing together",
            "copyright": null,
            "url": "https://images.prismic.io/decap/hHExiFsZ45EZ_u8s_decap-concert-pianist-and-red-accordion.jpg?auto=format,compress",
            "id": "hHExiFsZ45EZ_u8s",
            "edit": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "zoom": 1,
              "background": "transparent"
            }
          },
          "video": {
            "link_type": "Media"
          },
          "image_brief": "Three instruments side by side with their MIDI cables visible between them, workshop floor, 4:3",
          "media_side": "Image right",
          "aspect": "Landscape 4:3",
          "cta_label": "New organs",
          "cta_link": {
            "link_type": "Web",
