      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [
          {
            "question": "Which instrument suits which use?",
            "answer": [
              {
                "type": "list-item",
                "text": "Café, shop window or home: the Accordion Pedestal or Cube, with accompaniment from its own speakers.",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 26,
                    "type": "strong"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list-item",
                "text": "Events and touring: the Cube formats are compact and transport-friendly.",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 19,
                    "type": "strong"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list-item",
                "text": "Street and outdoor play: the hand-turned Bellow Organ.",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 24,
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "start": 41,
                    "end": 53,
                    "type": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "link_type": "Web",
                      "url": "/bellow-organ"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list-item",
                "text": "Your own performances or installations: Brass Core plays the brass part you feed it.",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 39,
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "start": 40,
                    "end": 50,
                    "type": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "link_type": "Web",
                      "url": "/brass-core"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Not sure? Tell us where it will play and we suggest a set-up.",
                "spans": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "question": "Can the instruments play together?",
            "answer": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Yes. They all use standard MIDI, so one arrangement can drive several instruments at once, each playing its own part. Virtual Orchestrion is built to do exactly that.",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "start": 118,
                    "end": 137,
                    "type": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "link_type": "Web",
                      "url": "/virtual-orchestrion"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "question": "Can I play them live?",
            "answer": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Yes. Connect a MIDI keyboard, controller, sequencer or DAW and the instruments respond in real time. The accordion's MIDI thru passes your playing on to the next instrument.",
                "spans": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "question": "What is the difference between the self-playing instruments and Brass Core?",
            "answer": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The self-playing instruments come with a player and music, ready to play. Brass Core, part of our Orchestrionix line, has no music library: it turns your own audio into real brass sound.",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "start": 98,
                    "end": 111,
                    "type": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "link_type": "Web",
                      "url": "/orchestrionix"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "question": "Do you deliver outside Belgium?",
            "answer": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Yes, we ship worldwide. Decap instruments play in Europe, Japan, the US, Australia and across Asia. Shipping is part of your quote.",
                "spans": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
